data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_00_ESjuQGixLrjL78p0QP2o3620","messageId":"15f71cb3-8e4b-4bb7-849f-3ed0d8da99bd","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"59c94751aad6e7f3db824614fc9732efc2bf1036a2c36b0885cc14a735d60a76\",\"query\":\"插件注册表 registry.generated 同步 生成\",\"total\":113,\"offset\":0,\"entries\":[{\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"title\":\"创建自定义插件\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/create-plugin.md\",\"summary\":\"已有插件的属性和组合无法满足需求时，可以在项目中编写新的 React 插件。先到插件检查可复用能力；只需让 Creator 帮你新增功能时，见增加新的界面功能。 以下路径相对于生成目录，默认为 src/agent-ui/。 开发时可以直接复用会话操作、状态 Hook、服务、事件、子插槽和消息展示接口。先查公共能力速查，各项提供使用前提和代码示例；插件组件和业务页面的接口入口也在其中区分。\",\"sha256\":\"e1ab2ce129fe251b39a7fa05e9fe0af74f01eeb50f4b8ef372781cc5f928fbbf\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s62\",\"title\":\"4. 更新注册并检查\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"sectionId\":\"s62\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"创建自定义插件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s9\",\"title\":\"1. 声明插件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"sectionId\":\"s9\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"title\":\"开始使用\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开始使用\",\"path\":\"start/index.md\",\"summary\":\"为你的产品加入 AI 助理，用自然语言调整界面。从现有 React 工程出发，完成接入、首次对话和第一次定制。\",\"sha256\":\"11355dee8e8f6d796be9f50499c23a9ba7a038530da015a286f66070a752a125\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s163\",\"title\":\"生成了哪些文件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"sectionId\":\"s163\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s225\",\"title\":\"挂载助理组件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"sectionId\":\"s225\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s155\",\"title\":\"初始化\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"sectionId\":\"s155\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"title\":\"工程结构与修改入口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/project-structure.md\",\"summary\":\"初始化后，Agent UI 源码默认放在 src/agent-ui/。以下路径都相对于这个目录；初始化时选择了其他目录，就在实际目录中找同名文件。 不同版本或历史工程的目录可能不同，先检查已有组件的导入和导出。官方插件通常由项目入口导入 npm 实现；已经接管的插件则引用本地实现。 新工程只生成布局中选用的插件入口，以及读取服务、传入数据和显示子插件所需的代码，添加插件时再生成对应入口。已经存在的项目入口会保留。 服务相关 Hook 统一放在 services/hooks/ 下：useConversations.ts、useConversationActions.ts 和按需生成的 useAu\",\"sha256\":\"d12f5d52751a6ac2fdd49c8a308ac1b080e59b0cf6076e91bbf7ffaa729b73db\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s25\",\"title\":\"根据修改目标选择入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"sectionId\":\"s25\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"工程结构与修改入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transactional-preview-composition\",\"title\":\"Transactional Preview Composition\",\"source\":\"internal\",\"topic\":\"更新与开发工具\",\"path\":\"references/docs/architecture/transactional-preview-composition.md\",\"summary\":\"预览组合的事务、revision、校验与恢复。\",\"sha256\":\"e0a374e737f76df6bc365eb7b2f64f2e21204fb58354e376385a3e63b47fe006\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transactional-preview-composition\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s19\",\"title\":\"Capability and active-runtime boundaries\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transactional-preview-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s19\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"title\":\"自定义 AG-UI 事件与消息渲染\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/custom-ag-ui-events.md\",\"summary\":\"按步骤将自定义 CUSTOM 事件解析并显示为消息卡片。\",\"sha256\":\"76bc2c6aeaa63f8b7ee3cf1263bda6df5ec37ed63d9af83845e80d2b4c4daf12\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s103\",\"title\":\"4. 注册并启用插件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"sectionId\":\"s103\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"自定义 AG-UI 事件与消息渲染\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s149\",\"title\":\"5. 检查结果\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"sectionId\":\"s149\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"title\":\"自定义结果展示\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/custom-renderers.md\",\"summary\":\"已有消息或工具结果需要不同的视觉结构时，在对应插件的项目入口中使用组件公开的渲染函数。保留原有消息名称、工具名称、运行状态，以及传给展示组件的当前消息或工具调用数据。 从自定义 AG-UI 事件开始接入新消息卡片时，见自定义 AG-UI 事件与消息渲染，其中包含事件格式、解析函数、插件注册与启用的完整示例。\",\"sha256\":\"1755a0b39145b093c5b9688528a8c591fe47c221fcbc0bf6bfe2684be972708a\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"自定义结果展示\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s41\",\"title\":\"工具结果与其他消息\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"sectionId\":\"s41\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s7\",\"title\":\"示例：调整图表数值\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"sectionId\":\"s7\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/plugin-api.md\",\"summary\":\"项目插件由能力声明、组件和可选的服务生命周期组成。创建文件与注册步骤见创建自定义插件。修改已有官方插件外观时，先使用组件公开属性。\",\"sha256\":\"cd30e68bc788dd22fdccc937313217ed5e3c3816b86e84f9138f758709423720\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s342\",\"title\":\"消息与工具结果展示\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s342\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s50\",\"title\":\"插件定义\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s50\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/unified-update-center\",\"title\":\"统一更新中心与兼容版本清单\",\"source\":\"internal\",\"topic\":\"更新与开发工具\",\"path\":\"references/docs/architecture/unified-update-center.md\",\"summary\":\"兼容清单、独立包版本、只读发现、具体升级确认、安装恢复与源码同步。\",\"sha256\":\"f3aa1af4a67c6c5e8279c7aaf74294907ecf2aa91c4a6eddfa4a90cae4081a4d\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/unified-update-center\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s90\",\"title\":\"6. 升级后的托管源码同步\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/unified-update-center\",\"sectionId\":\"s90\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s64\",\"title\":\"4. 用户确认与 npm 升级计划\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/unified-update-center\",\"sectionId\":\"s64\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s9\",\"title\":\"1. 用户流程与范围\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/unified-update-center\",\"sectionId\":\"s9\"}}}]}],\"nextOffset\":8}}","role":"tool"}

